      "text": "六亲捷要歌",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c143:p0001",
      "sha256": "ebf6c10d988d37cf4ef72ab781dee71dbd7ddddfbb51d5af55be77490ed93d4c"
    },
    {
      "section": "六亲捷要歌",
      "text": "分禄须伤主馈人，比肩重叠损严亲。正财克母偏财父，夫妇相刑值退神。",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c143:p0002",
      "sha256": "7832674798d56c4ef0d9be8a9958ddd0928086dcd0f0832e9b15e6596788584f"
    },
    {
      "section": "六亲捷要歌",
      "text": "食神有寿妻多子，偏官多女少麒麟。乘旺伤官嗣必绝，中和印绶自荣身。",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c143:p0003",
      "sha256": "a08664eeddf849ab2b0909da476dcf6184ab787ee6224a9734cbc16ceaf7e81f"
    },
    {
      "section": "六亲捷要歌",
      "text": "眉批：以上八句皆主男命刑害之言。有比有刃者过旺无制，主克父母刑妻。月令印绶格者，八字中财多克母，印多克子，大运遇财亦然。",
      "layer": "historical_commentary",
      "commentary_spans": [
